=\"color: #77767B; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: 160%; letter-spacing: -0.36px; margin-top: 8px;\"> Shipment Reference: {{shipmentReferenceNumber}} </p> </div> <!-- Title --> <h1>Dear {{customerName}},</h1> <!-- Description --> <p>{{containerTerminalUpdates}}</p> <p> </p> <!-- Button Link --> <a href=\"https://${domain_name}/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/overview\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color:#202122; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 360px; border: 2px solid #202122; padding: 11px 30px 12px 30px; display: inline-block; margin-top:10px;\">View Shipment</a> <p>For additional assistance or inquiries, please contact our support team at <a href=\"mailto:bookings.us@skypace.com\" style=\"color:#202122;\">bookings.us@skypace.com</a></p> <p>Thank you for choosing Skypace.</p> <p>Always with you, </p> <p>The Skypace Team</p> </div> <!-- Contacts --> <div class=\"contacts\"> <h2>Skypace</h2> <p>7915 FM 1960 Houston, ste 224 TX 77070, USA</p> <p>+1 832 982 1717</p> <p><a href=\"mailto:bookings.us@skypace.com\" style=\"color:#202122;\">bookings.us@skypace.com</a></p> </div> ${email_footer}"
